<title>HONG KONG: Road King says increases highway tolls.</title>
<headline>Road King says increases highway tolls.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Road King Infrastructure Ltd said on Monday it would increase the toll charges between 25 and 50 percent on two of its highways in China's Guangdong province with effect from October 1.</p>
<p>The approval was given by the Guangdong Provincial Price bureau, it said. The two highways are part of Road King's Jieyang Highway Network in Guangdong, China.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
